.TH RSRCPROBE 1
.SH NAME
rsrcprobe \- exercise resource limit and usage syscalls
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rsrcprobe
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B rsrcprobe
is a guest regression probe for the POSIX-shaped resource API. It checks
getrlimit, setrlimit, getrusage, RLIMIT_NOFILE enforcement, stable fixed
limits, invalid-argument errors, and waited-child/self usage reporting.
